00:42:14,000 --> 00:42:15,332
Yes, please.

531
00:42:15,333 --> 00:42:17,250
- Honey, wait.
- Come here, honey.

532
00:42:17,750 --> 00:42:18,791
Right.

533
00:42:19,791 --> 00:42:22,250
- Thanks.
- Auntie's cutie-pie.

534
00:42:28,291 --> 00:42:29,875
What's the matter, Elize?

535
00:42:34,083 --> 00:42:36,375
I'm terrified of losing Marcos.

536
00:42:39,416 --> 00:42:41,208
Why are you saying that?

537
00:42:42,666 --> 00:42:44,833
I've lost so much in my life.

538
00:42:47,625 --> 00:42:49,750
My dad cheated on my mom a lot.

539
00:42:52,791 --> 00:42:54,166
Then one day he left.

540
00:42:56,416 --> 00:42:58,125
He abandoned us.

541
00:43:04,750 --> 00:43:06,541
Wasn't it for the best?

542
00:43:09,250 --> 00:43:11,250
You can't get over a thing like that.

543
00:43:14,541 --> 00:43:17,666
Then my mom married a guy
worse than my dad.

544
00:43:19,000 --> 00:43:20,583
My stepfather.

545
00:43:24,958 --> 00:43:27,333
It started when I was about 12.

546
00:43:28,958 --> 00:43:31,166
And it happened until I was 15.

547
00:43:35,541 --> 00:43:37,791
I said no so many times.

548
00:43:42,416 --> 00:43:45,333
I don't want my girl to grow up
away from her dad.

549
00:43:49,333 --> 00:43:51,416
I can't lose my family.

550
00:43:53,291 --> 00:43:54,916
I fought so hard for this.

551
00:43:55,958 --> 00:43:57,291
You won't lose it.

552
00:44:28,625 --> 00:44:31,458
MY FLIGHT WAS CANCELED, DON'T WAIT UP

553
00:44:53,250 --> 00:44:54,333
Honey?

554
00:45:13,833 --> 00:45:14,833
Honey?

555
00:45:15,333 --> 00:45:16,540
Let's go to bed.

556
00:45:16,541 --> 00:45:18,291
Let me sleep here.

557
00:45:20,750 --> 00:45:23,458
- Let's go to the bedroom.
- I love you.

558
00:46:49,333 --> 00:46:50,415
YOU'RE SO HOT

559
00:46:50,416 --> 00:46:53,250
<i>"I can't wait for you to quit VipClass."</i>

560
00:47:28,500 --> 00:47:29,666
Are you asleep?

561
00:47:34,750 --> 00:47:37,458
Seriously. Come here.

562
00:47:40,375 --> 00:47:41,875
Come here.

563
00:47:45,250 --> 00:47:47,125
Are you going to leave me hanging?

564
00:47:47,875 --> 00:47:49,291
I'm just tired.

565
00:47:50,458 --> 00:47:54,332
You used to spend all night
serving clients in that club.

566
00:47:54,333 --> 00:47:55,790
You were never tired.

567
00:47:55,791 --> 00:47:57,291
You didn't just say that.

568
00:47:58,166 --> 00:47:59,333
Am I wrong?

569
00:48:01,250 --> 00:48:05,166
You have a nanny, a maid,
luxury, a credit card, a car.

570
00:48:05,666 --> 00:48:08,291
What more do you want? Say it.

571
00:48:08,791 --> 00:48:09,750
Fuck!

572
00:48:10,250 --> 00:48:11,625
I don't want to fight.

573
00:48:13,291 --> 00:48:14,625
Should I pay you?

574
00:48:20,208 --> 00:48:25,500
One hundred, two hundred,
three hundred, five hundred.

575
00:48:26,458 --> 00:48:28,333
Take it all, you whore.

576
00:48:28,875 --> 00:48:31,040
I'm not your whore. I'm your wife.

577
00:48:31,041 --> 00:48:32,833
I'm the mother of your child.

578
00:48:34,416 --> 00:48:35,916
That's the problem.

579
00:48:37,750 --> 00:48:39,082
You're leaving me.

580
00:48:39,083 --> 00:48:40,499
Oh, not this again.

581
00:48:40,500 --> 00:48:45,082
You promised you wouldn't treat me
like you treated your ex-wife. You said--

582
00:48:45,083 --> 00:48:46,791
Stop! Enough!

583
00:48:47,666 --> 00:48:49,000
Look at you.

584
00:48:49,750 --> 00:48:51,208
You're hysterical.

585
00:48:52,833 --> 00:48:56,625
I'm afraid to leave my daughter with you.

586
00:48:57,958 --> 00:48:59,333
Go get help.

587
00:49:03,500 --> 00:49:05,000
Crazy bitch.

588
00:49:21,458 --> 00:49:24,083
THE LARGEST
MENTAL HEALTH CENTER IN SÃO PAULO

589
00:49:30,458 --> 00:49:31,916
"Admission"?

590
00:49:32,416 --> 00:49:35,458
"Private room, 680 a day."

591
00:49:36,125 --> 00:49:38,999
"Part-time, 350 per day."

592
00:49:39,000 --> 00:49:42,625
"Medication, 120 to 450."

593
00:50:06,083 --> 00:50:08,874
<i>This is Dani's voicemail.
I can't answer right now.</i>

594
00:50:08,875 --> 00:50:11,333
<i>Leave a message at the tone.</i>

595
00:51:11,583 --> 00:51:15,375
WHERE R U, BABE? R U COMING?

596
00:51:26,250 --> 00:51:28,041
INCOMING CALL

597
00:51:29,458 --> 00:51:30,416
Hello?

598
00:51:31,791 --> 00:51:32,958
Hello?

599
00:51:34,416 --> 00:51:35,541
Hello?

600
00:51:48,708 --> 00:51:50,457
Could you get me a martini?

601
00:51:50,458 --> 00:51:53,250
Same for me. Make it a double.

602
00:51:54,583 --> 00:51:55,665
Celebrating?

603
00:51:55,666 --> 00:51:56,832
Trying to cheer up.

604
00:51:56,833 --> 00:51:58,916
A client stood me up
and won't answer the phone.

605
00:51:59,791 --> 00:52:01,250
Well, just look around.

606
00:52:02,500 --> 00:52:04,333
No shortage of clients here, hon.

607
00:52:06,375 --> 00:52:07,541
Are you new here?

608
00:52:08,666 --> 00:52:10,125
Kind of.

609
00:52:10,791 --> 00:52:12,333
I used to come here a lot.

610
00:52:13,000 --> 00:52:16,124
Then I stopped after I went exclusive.

611
00:52:16,125 --> 00:52:18,375
- That's my dream.
- Really?

612
00:52:18,875 --> 00:52:20,915
Oh, it's not that hard.

613
00:52:20,916 --> 00:52:24,000
Just avoid married men.
It's always a trap.

614
00:52:24,958 --> 00:52:26,375
I like married men.

615
00:52:27,333 --> 00:52:28,749
How dangerous.

616
00:52:28,750 --> 00:52:31,874
No, I just think it's easier.

617
00:52:31,875 --> 00:52:36,291
They're always worried about their wives,
so it's less of a headache for us.

618
00:52:37,375 --> 00:52:39,041
I have one like that.

619
00:52:40,375 --> 00:52:41,666
A prince?

620
00:52:42,416 --> 00:52:43,750
Well, sort of.

621
00:52:44,625 --> 00:52:47,083
He says he'll leave his wife for me.

622
00:52:48,208 --> 00:52:49,790
He's obsessed with me.

623
00:52:49,791 --> 00:52:51,874
He gives me gifts, takes me on trips,

624
00:52:51,875 --> 00:52:55,624
treats me to sushi, teaches me about wine.

625
00:52:55,625 --> 00:52:57,707
In his case, I get it.

626
00:52:57,708 --> 00:53:00,582
His wife is kind of out of it.

627
00:53:00,583 --> 00:53:02,457
She's a mental case.

628
00:53:02,458 --> 00:53:05,207
She takes meds, she's a psycho.

629
00:53:05,208 --> 00:53:08,875
They'll have her admitted next week.

630
00:53:53,333 --> 00:53:54,457
So?

631
00:53:54,458 --> 00:53:56,583
He's still in there with her.

632
00:53:57,333 --> 00:53:59,166
This is from when they arrived.

633
00:53:59,666 --> 00:54:01,082
They arrived separately.

634
00:54:01,083 --> 00:54:04,916
If you look closely,
her car's just like yours. Same color.

635
00:54:06,458 --> 00:54:08,958
- They've been there two hours.
- I knew it.

636
00:54:09,541 --> 00:54:12,041
I took pictures. The full package.

637
00:54:12,541 --> 00:54:14,375
Your lawyer will love it.

638
00:54:14,875 --> 00:54:16,875
- Mrs. Elize--
- Go away!

639
00:54:17,583 --> 00:54:18,875
Send me everything, go.

640
00:55:14,541 --> 00:55:17,250
18 HOURS AFTER THE CRIME

641
00:55:19,583 --> 00:55:22,833
WHIRLWIND

642
00:56:34,458 --> 00:56:35,624
Hi, Marcinha.

643
00:56:35,625 --> 00:56:37,749
I went out for a bit. How's the baby?

644
00:56:37,750 --> 00:56:39,665
<i>She's a little warm.</i>

645
00:56:39,666 --> 00:56:43,833
<i>She has a fever, 98 degrees.
Can I give her the usual medicine?</i>

646
00:56:44,333 --> 00:56:45,874
- Yes.
<i>- Twenty drops?</i>

647
00:56:45,875 --> 00:56:47,665
Yes. Is Marcos there?

648
00:56:47,666 --> 00:56:51,333
<i>- No, ma'am.
- Okay, I'll call him. Bye.</i>

649
00:57:56,375 --> 00:57:57,957
Marcinha, how are things?

650
00:57:57,958 --> 00:58:00,333
<i>- Almost 104 degrees.
- 104?</i>

651
00:58:01,541 --> 00:58:04,207
- Did you bathe her?
<i>- Yes, I don't know what else to do.</i>

652
00:58:04,208 --> 00:58:06,916
Okay, I'm heading home. Bye.

653
00:58:23,666 --> 00:58:24,833
Fuck!

654
00:58:28,708 --> 00:58:29,916
Pull over, ma'am.

655
00:58:39,375 --> 00:58:40,707
Good evening.

656
00:58:40,708 --> 00:58:43,000
- Good evening.
- We'll run a check.

657
00:58:58,416 --> 00:59:00,457
What's wrong? Are you nervous, ma'am?

658
00:59:00,458 --> 00:59:01,500
No.

659
00:59:02,000 --> 00:59:04,749
You know what? I really need to get home.

660
00:59:04,750 --> 00:59:07,082
My baby's running a fever.

661
00:59:07,083 --> 00:59:09,875
Could you let me go quickly, please?

662
00:59:12,541 --> 00:59:14,083
License and registration.

663
00:59:27,166 --> 00:59:28,041
Just a minute.

664
00:59:56,791 --> 00:59:58,874
The car's registration is expired.

665
00:59:58,875 --> 01:00:02,208
I could seize the car.
Ask your husband to sort it out.

666
01:00:03,125 --> 01:00:04,582
You're free to go.

667
01:00:04,583 --> 01:00:06,500
- You two, stop right there!
- Thanks.

668
01:00:07,416 --> 01:00:10,041
There! Pull over.

669
01:01:18,208 --> 01:01:21,458
HAS THE FEVER GONE DOWN?

670
01:02:02,083 --> 01:02:03,416
Jesus.

671
01:02:29,250 --> 01:02:34,375
I haven't heard from him in two days.
Let me know if you hear anything. Thanks.

672
01:02:40,208 --> 01:02:44,500
I know you're nervous, dear,
but try to remember. Make an effort.

673
01:02:51,375 --> 01:02:53,374
I've told you what I remember.

674
01:02:53,375 --> 01:02:55,166
Calm down and think carefully.

675
01:02:55,708 --> 01:02:57,958
Even the smallest detail could help.

676
01:03:02,125 --> 01:03:04,665
I woke up to him
rummaging through his things.

677
01:03:04,666 --> 01:03:05,875
What things?

678
01:03:07,083 --> 01:03:08,625
Oh, a carry-on bag.

679
01:03:16,000 --> 01:03:17,083
Some clothes.

680
01:03:20,833 --> 01:03:24,541
Money, laptop, and his cell phone.

681
01:03:27,666 --> 01:03:30,499
- He must've been kidnapped.
- Don't say that.

682
01:03:30,500 --> 01:03:33,540
Marcos disappears
when we're selling the company?

683
01:03:33,541 --> 01:03:36,333
- It's no coincidence.
- Then why hasn't anyone called?

684
01:03:39,791 --> 01:03:42,875
Are you sure he didn't say anything else
before he left?

685
01:03:44,625 --> 01:03:46,875
He said he'd be back late.

686
01:03:48,875 --> 01:03:50,541
That he might not come back.

687
01:03:52,791 --> 01:03:54,583
He leaned over the bed…

688
01:03:56,375 --> 01:03:57,750
and gave me a kiss.

689
01:03:59,833 --> 01:04:03,291
And said that a man's gotta do
what a man's gotta do.

690
01:04:05,041 --> 01:04:08,083
I just want him to be okay, that's all.

691
01:04:09,375 --> 01:04:10,458
Calm down.

692
01:04:11,625 --> 01:04:12,750
That must be the police.

693
01:04:19,208 --> 01:04:20,791
Marcos will turn up.

694
01:04:21,500 --> 01:04:22,624
He will.

695
01:04:22,625 --> 01:04:24,541
There must be a reason.

696
01:04:26,791 --> 01:04:29,000
I'm here for you
if you need anything, okay?

697
01:04:30,625 --> 01:04:31,625
I know.

698
01:04:32,208 --> 01:04:33,624
Don't forget.

699
01:04:33,625 --> 01:04:34,625
Thanks.

700
01:04:35,916 --> 01:04:37,041
Stay calm.

701
01:04:37,750 --> 01:04:39,208
There's still time.

702
01:04:39,708 --> 01:04:44,165
He hasn't made contact yet,
but we're tracking everything.

703
01:04:44,166 --> 01:04:45,957
- Clarice.
- How are you?

704
01:04:45,958 --> 01:04:48,374
- Nice to meet you.
- Elize, Marcos's wife.

705
01:04:48,375 --> 01:04:50,083
- Good afternoon.
- Good afternoon.

706
01:04:50,708 --> 01:04:51,749
Any news?

707
01:04:51,750 --> 01:04:55,457
Chief Aquino told us
they've put out Marcos' photo

708
01:04:55,458 --> 01:04:58,082
and alerted police departments
and hospitals.

709
01:04:58,083 --> 01:05:01,416
The anti-kidnapping unit will track
any ransom calls.

710
01:05:06,666 --> 01:05:08,249
<i>A dark mystery.</i>

711
01:05:08,250 --> 01:05:11,874
<i>Fragments of a body
were left along dirt roads</i>

712
01:05:11,875 --> 01:05:13,957
<i>near the city of São Paulo,</i>

713
01:05:13,958 --> 01:05:16,457
<i>more precisely
in the Caucaia do Alto district,</i>

714
01:05:16,458 --> 01:05:18,540
<i>a rural zone in the city of Cotia,</i>

715
01:05:18,541 --> 01:05:21,374
<i>forming a sinister puzzle.</i>

716
01:05:21,375 --> 01:05:23,749
<i>On the side of one of the dirt roads,</i>

717
01:05:23,750 --> 01:05:27,707
<i>a single leg was found
in a blue trash bag.</i>

718
01:05:27,708 --> 01:05:29,207
TELL ELIZE AND MOM I'M FINE…

719
01:05:29,208 --> 01:05:32,040
<i>City guards have found the missing limb.</i>

720
01:05:32,041 --> 01:05:36,165
<i>The search
for the missing body parts continues.</i>

721
01:05:36,166 --> 01:05:38,499
<i>Hands, arms, and the head.</i>

722
01:05:38,500 --> 01:05:43,000
<i>Crucial pieces to solving this mystery
and identifying the victim.</i>

723
01:05:45,000 --> 01:05:47,957
The police will keep us posted.

724
01:05:47,958 --> 01:05:50,582
We can't wait, it's been nine days.

725
01:05:50,583 --> 01:05:56,041
Marcos sent an email, made deposits,
but can't get to his cell? It's illogical.

726
01:05:57,208 --> 01:06:00,040
There was some activity
in Marcos's bank account.

727
01:06:00,041 --> 01:06:05,540
A large deposit, 15 thousand reais
at a bank in Vila Brasilândia.

728
01:06:05,541 --> 01:06:08,249
It's near the church we go to.

729
01:06:08,250 --> 01:06:09,874
What about the email?

730
01:06:09,875 --> 01:06:12,249
It seems to have come from his laptop.

731
01:06:12,250 --> 01:06:15,499
They'll trace the IP address
and find out where it came from.

732
01:06:15,500 --> 01:06:17,333
Can they do that?

733
01:06:17,833 --> 01:06:19,165
Apparently, yes.

734
01:06:19,166 --> 01:06:22,666
Then he wasn't kidnapped. Marcos is fine.

735
01:06:23,291 --> 01:06:24,875
A mother's intuition.

736
01:06:37,458 --> 01:06:39,666
No!

737
01:06:40,375 --> 01:06:44,165
<i>New blue trash bags
were found in the Cotia area.</i>

738
01:06:44,166 --> 01:06:47,624
<i>This time, the body parts found
were an arm</i>

739
01:06:47,625 --> 01:06:50,291
<i>and the head of a victim
of Japanese descent.</i>

740
01:06:51,125 --> 01:06:54,332
<i>- With the legs, torso, and hips…
- Any ID yet?</i>

741
01:06:54,333 --> 01:06:56,874
- No.
<i>- The agents on the case…</i>

742
01:06:56,875 --> 01:06:58,500
- Calm down, Aunt.
- It's not him.

743
01:06:59,000 --> 01:07:01,665
- No. It's not him.
- Sit down.

744
01:07:01,666 --> 01:07:02,749
- Sit down.
- Sit down.

745
01:07:02,750 --> 01:07:07,458
<i>- …they weren't
as well-preserved as expected.</i>

746
01:07:08,583 --> 01:07:13,958
<i>The head that was found could therefore
significantly advance the investigation.</i>

747
01:07:47,541 --> 01:07:48,416
Mrs. Elize.

748
01:07:49,000 --> 01:07:49,915
What?

749
01:07:49,916 --> 01:07:51,875
It's about Mr. Marcos.

750
01:07:55,708 --> 01:07:58,624
<i>The identity of the victim
of the brutal crime</i>

751
01:07:58,625 --> 01:08:00,832
<i>that shocked the country is confirmed.</i>

752
01:08:00,833 --> 01:08:05,915
<i>It's Marcos Matsunaga, businessman
and heir to a billion-dollar empire.</i>

753
01:08:05,916 --> 01:08:07,957
<i>The murder happened 16 days ago.</i>

754
01:08:07,958 --> 01:08:12,415
<i>It's unclear if the crime
is linked to the company's sale.</i>

755
01:08:12,416 --> 01:08:16,499
<i>Parts of the body were found
on dirt roads in Cotia.</i>

756
01:08:16,500 --> 01:08:18,415
<i>After identification, the family waits…</i>

757
01:08:18,416 --> 01:08:20,833
- Don't. Take her upstairs.
<i>- …for the body.</i>

758
01:08:21,750 --> 01:08:24,208
<i>We'll be back with more information.</i>

759
01:08:27,541 --> 01:08:29,208
Go. Go.

760
01:08:34,833 --> 01:08:35,915
Chief?

761
01:08:35,916 --> 01:08:37,290
May we come in?

762
01:08:37,291 --> 01:08:38,291
Of course.

763
01:08:40,375 --> 01:08:41,540
Everything okay?

764
01:08:41,541 --> 01:08:42,999
You tell me.

765
01:08:43,000 --> 01:08:44,999
Any news about Marcos?

766
01:08:45,000 --> 01:08:45,999
Stay calm.

767
01:08:46,000 --> 01:08:48,333
We just came to collect
some of his belongings.

768
01:08:49,166 --> 01:08:50,291
That's okay, right?

769
01:09:03,250 --> 01:09:04,958
Are you sure it's him?

770
01:09:07,083 --> 01:09:09,041
We still have to do the DNA test.

771
01:09:12,916 --> 01:09:13,791
What's that?

772
01:09:16,000 --> 01:09:17,666
Standard procedure.

773
01:09:28,166 --> 01:09:30,958
Come with me to the station, will you?

774
01:09:32,250 --> 01:09:33,833
We're recording, okay?

775
01:09:34,875 --> 01:09:35,999
Okay.

776
01:09:36,000 --> 01:09:37,624
State your full name.

777
01:09:37,625 --> 01:09:40,332
Elize Araújo Kitano Matsunaga.

778
01:09:40,333 --> 01:09:41,666
Marital status?

779
01:09:42,958 --> 01:09:44,000
Widow?

780
01:09:44,708 --> 01:09:45,750
What?

781
01:09:46,625 --> 01:09:47,707
Widow?

782
01:09:47,708 --> 01:09:49,041
Now you are, right?

783
01:09:52,500 --> 01:09:54,708
That was the last time Marcos was seen.

784
01:09:56,833 --> 01:09:58,041
An error?

785
01:09:58,541 --> 01:09:59,833
An error?

786
01:10:01,125 --> 01:10:02,625
A system error?

787
01:10:04,750 --> 01:10:06,250
Maybe he took the stairs.

788
